   "operationId": "hooks.wechatpay.transaction.notify",
   "method": "POST",
   "path": "/hooks/wechatpay/transactions",
   "section": "3.1",
   "requestSchemas": [
    "WechatpayNotification",
    "WechatpayTransactionResource"
   ],
   "responseSchema": "HookAck",
   "errors": [
    "WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_INVALID",
    "WEBHOOK_TIMESTAMP_SKEWED",
    "WEBHOOK_KEY_NOT_FOUND",
    "WEBHOOK_DECRYPT_FAILED",
    "WEBHOOK_PAYLOAD_INVALID",
    "WEBHOOK_PERSIST_FAILED"
   ],
   "events": [
    "payment_txn.succeeded",
    "payment_exception.opened",
    "billing_order.paid",
    "billing_order.cancelled",
    "billing.order_fulfilled",
    "billing_order.fulfillment_blocked",
    "billing.subscription.activated",
    "billing.subscription.renewal_scheduled",
    "billing.subscription.upgraded",
    "billing.points.granted",
    "billing.points.purchased",
    "payment_exception.auto_healed"
   ],
   "permission": null,
   "capability": null,
   "transitions": [
    "webhook_event.process_state: — → processed / ignored（内联 T1；插入即 processed，判为 ignored 时同事务改写；15-integration-ops.md:114）",
    "webhook_event.process_state: received / failed → processed / ignored（同一事件再次到达时的内联重处理；dead 行不处理；15-integration-ops.md:117）",
    "webhook_event.process_state: — → failed（T1 失败后的兜底写入 T1′，mode = inbox，attempts = 1；15-integration-ops.md:116）",
    "webhook_event.process_state: received / failed → failed / dead（已存在的行重处理再次失败，T1′ 推进 attempts，满 8 次进 dead；15-integration-ops.md:118-119）",
    "payment_txn.status: created / prepaid / closed → succeeded（recordChannelSuccess，T1；08-billing-payment.md:317）",
    "payment_exception.status: — → open（status_mismatch，detected_by = callback，T1；先锁 billing_order 再开单，刷新 has_open_exception；08-billing-payment.md:760）",
    "billing_order.status: pending_payment → paid（applyPayment，提交后内联；08-billing-payment.md:164）",
    "billing_order.fulfillment_status: none → done / blocked（提交后内联；08-billing-payment.md:199）",
    "billing_order.status: pending_payment → cancelled（amount_mismatch / payer_mismatch，提交后内联；同事务取消 po.expire；08-billing-payment.md:165）",
    "billing_account.sub_status: none / expired → active（fulfill，提交后内联；07-billing-ledger.md:436）",
    "subscription_term.status: （新建）→ active / scheduled（fulfill，提交后内联；07-billing-ledger.md:539-540）",
    "grant_schedule.status: pending → granted（第 0 个月，提交后内联）",
    "payment_exception.status: — → open（amount_mismatch / payer_mismatch / duplicate_receipt / paid_after_cancel / fulfillment_blocked，detected_by = apply，提交后内联；08-billing-payment.md:760）",
    "payment_exception.status: open → auto_healed（bill_only 由入账函数重新归类，提交后内联；08-billing-payment.md:767）"
   ],
   "xAuth": "signed",
   "clerkView": null,
   "xIdempotent": "natural",
   "idempotentBy": [
    "uq_webhook_event_provider_event_id"
   ],
   "lockVersion": false,
   "version": "V1.0",
   "hookMode": "inline",
   "note": "T1 同事务落资金事实；status_mismatch 分支不持 payment_txn 锁、先锁 billing_order 再开单；T1 失败走兜底 T1′；提交后内联 applyPayment 失败不影响应答，兜底归 x01（billing.applyPaymentFallback、tx.unapplied_scan）；事件以 x01 事件目录为准（A95）；差异单列与键见 2.6"
  },
  {
   "operationId": "hooks.wechatpay.refund.notify",
   "method": "POST",
   "path": "/hooks/wechatpay/refunds",
   "section": "3.2",
   "requestSchemas": [
    "WechatpayNotification",
    "WechatpayRefundResource"
   ],
   "responseSchema": "HookAck",
   "errors": [
    "WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_INVALID",
    "WEBHOOK_TIMESTAMP_SKEWED",
    "WEBHOOK_KEY_NOT_FOUND",
    "WEBHOOK_DECRYPT_FAILED",
    "WEBHOOK_PAYLOAD_INVALID",
    "WEBHOOK_PERSIST_FAILED"
   ],
   "events": [
    "refund.completed",
    "approval.executed",
    "billing_order.refunded",
    "invoice.rejected",
    "payment_exception.resolved",
    "payment_exception.opened",
    "refund.execution_failed"
   ],
   "permission": null,
   "capability": null,
   "transitions": [
    "webhook_event.process_state: — → processed / ignored（内联；15-integration-ops.md:114）",
    "webhook_event.process_state: received / failed → processed / ignored（同一事件再次到达时的内联重处理；15-integration-ops.md:117）",
    "webhook_event.process_state: — → failed（处理事务失败后的兜底写入 T1′，mode = inbox；15-integration-ops.md:116）",
    "webhook_event.process_state: received / failed → failed / dead（已存在的行重处理再次失败；15-integration-ops.md:118-119）",
    "refund_txn.status: 任意 → succeeded（此前为失败终态的记 is_late_success；08-billing-payment.md:669）",
    "refund_txn.status: created → processing（受理结果尚未落库的竞态，随后再置 closed / abnormal；08-billing-payment.md:663）",
    "refund_txn.status: processing → closed（08-billing-payment.md:666）",
    "refund_txn.status: processing → abnormal（08-billing-payment.md:667）",
    "refund_request.status: executing → done（08-billing-payment.md:531）",
    "refund_request.status: pending_execution → done（退款回调晚到，A102；同事务取消执行时限 sla.breach；08-billing-payment.md:529）",
    "refund_request.status: executing → pending_execution（退款交易到达失败终态；08-billing-payment.md:532）",
    "billing_order.status: paid → refunded（入账收款累计退款 ≥ 实付；08-billing-payment.md:177）",
    "invoice_request.status: pending → rejected（reject_kind = order_refunded，写 rejected_at；同事务取消 sla.breach；08-billing-payment.md:1114）",
    "payment_exception.status: resolving → resolved（差异转入的退款完成；08-billing-payment.md:763）",
    "payment_exception.status: — → open（refund_over / status_mismatch（迟到成功）/ refund_amount_mismatch，detected_by = callback；08-billing-payment.md:760）"
   ],
   "xAuth": "signed",
   "clerkView": null,
   "xIdempotent": "natural",
   "idempotentBy": [
    "uq_webhook_event_provider_event_id"
   ],
   "lockVersion": false,
   "version": "V1.0",
   "hookMode": "inline",
   "note": "同事务取消该退款交易未触发的 rf.poll（成功或 closed 时）；申请迁移只在本交易是申请当前的退款交易时发生；申请 done 时同事务清除开票申请的 held_by_refund_request_id（不是状态迁移，08-billing-payment.md:1131）；完成动作与 a07 3.63 一致；与 rf.poll、bill.download 同一段退款结果处理代码；差异单列与键见 2.6"
  },
